      "title": "朝に動くと、その日の後半が崩れにくくなる",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style='position:absolute;left:95px;top:205px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;'><div class='panel' style='width:220px;height:170px;padding:20px;border-color:#ff6d0055;'><div class='orange' style='font-size:20px;font-weight:900;'>朝に動く</div><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px;'>光を浴びる\n血流が上がる</div></div><div style='font-size:46px;font-weight:900;color:#38bdf8;'>→</div><div class='panel' style='width:220px;height:170px;padding:20px;border-color:#38bdf855;'><div class='blue' style='font-size:20px;font-weight:900;'>気分が整う</div><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px;'>判断が\nぶれにくい</div></div><div style='font-size:46px;font-weight:900;color:#4ade80;'>→</div><div class='panel' style='width:220px;height:170px;padding:20px;border-color:#4ade8055;'><div class='green' style='font-size:20px;font-weight:900;'>食事が整う</div><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px;'>夜の崩れ\n減少</div></div><div style='font-size:46px;font-weight:900;color:#facc15;'>→</div><div class='panel' style='width:220px;height:170px;padding:20px;border-color:#facc1555;'><div class='yellow' style='font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#facc15;'>継続しやすい</div><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px;'>翌日も\n戻りやすい</div></div></div>"
    },
    {
